<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Hui Shung buys 54,500T soy/corn at tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Hui Shung buys 54,500T soy/corn at tender.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Hui Shung Group bought a combined shipment comprising 38,500 tonnes of U.S. No.2 soybeans and 16,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn from U.S. Cargill at a tender on Thursday, traders said.</p>
